==Skin Trivia==
*The default skin is based on the [[wp:Humvee|military vehicle of the same name]] made by AM General, as evidenced by its similar design and same name.
*The {{Color|Premium|Classic}} skin is based on the [[Truck1]], which is based on the [[wp:M939 series 5-ton 6x6 truck|M939 military multipurpose truck]] made by AM General.
*Weirdly, the {{Color|Hexscape|Wasteland}} skin, despite having translucent windshields, has no visible driver.

===Roblox Catalog===
*The goggles worn by the humanoid inside the second version of the Default and first version of the {{Color|Premium|Classic}} vehicle were a re-textured version of the the {{RLinkC|833772989|Laser Spec Special Forces Goggles}} accessory from the Roblox catalog.

